      <h1 class="article-title">The Chalcedonian Definition</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">451 AD</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">The definitive statement on the two natures of Christ in one person.</p>
      
      
      <div class="faith-doc-actions">
        
      </div>
    </div>
